<%= header_section(@subject) %>
<div>
  <p>You recently reported as fraud the transaction for your purchase of <%= link_to @product.name, @product.long_url %> for <%= @price %>, made on <%= @purchase_date %>. A receipt was sent to <%= @purchase.email %> — please check your Spam folder if you are unable to locate it.</p>
  <p>If you reported this purchase because you didn't recognize "GUMRD.COM" on your account statement, or if you didn't report this purchase, you can contact your bank to cancel the report.</p>
  <p>If you would like to manage your membership you can visit <%= link_to "subscription settings", @edit_card_url %>.</p>
  <p><a class="button primary" href="<%= @edit_card_url %>">Manage membership</a></p>
</div>
<div>
  <h3>Have any questions?</h3>
  <p>Contact <%= @subscription.link.user.display_name %> by replying to this email</p>
</div>
